consigo tudo.

776
01:02:12,828 --> 01:02:15,039
Sou pássaro preto.

777
01:02:15,040 --> 01:02:17,374
Arrume logo.
Precisamos ir.

778
01:02:29,054 --> 01:02:30,646
Se apresse.

779
01:02:35,435 --> 01:02:38,095
Aqui!

780
01:02:38,096 --> 01:02:39,422
Por aqui!

781
01:02:39,423 --> 01:02:42,443
Mooltee!
Mooltee! Por aqui!

782
01:02:42,969 --> 01:02:44,319
Me soltem.

783
01:02:44,320 --> 01:02:45,921
Socorro!

784
01:02:47,114 --> 01:02:48,699
Por aqui!

785
01:02:51,953 --> 01:02:53,504
Me soltem.

786
01:02:57,208 --> 01:02:58,642
Mooltee!

787
01:02:59,794 --> 01:03:02,046
Mooltee!
Você achou Koa?

788
01:03:02,047 --> 01:03:03,364
